            <div class="status-item"><span class="badge badge--progress">Predicted</span> Structure prediction &amp; validation (both domains)</div>
            <div class="status-item"><span class="badge badge--progress">Predicted</span> Cex cellobiose-docking study</div>
            <div class="status-item"><span class="badge badge--progress">Predicted</span> Mutation-candidate screening, Cex &amp; CenA</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="status-card">
          <h3>Wet Lab</h3>
          <div class="status-items">
            <div class="status-item"><span class="badge badge--confirmed">Confirmed</span> Cloning, library generation, sequencing</div>
            <div class="status-item"><span class="badge badge--confirmed">Confirmed</span> Congo red + X-gluc screens (30 mutants)</div>
            <div class="status-item"><span class="badge badge--confirmed">Confirmed</span> Quantitative MUC assay, validated &amp; applied</div>
